    "equation": "Driven Connor-Stevens A-current spiking (ten upward v>=0 crossings over 60 one-millisecond macro steps) advanced with the exact macro-step integrator: 100 inner four-stage classical RK4 sub-steps of dt=0.01 per macro step, rising-edge crossing evaluated only on the macro boundary, no reset. The six-state membrane and modified Na/K/A-type gating equations (numpy exp/exprel rates and the cube-root A-gate) are independently re-derived from the Connor-Walter-McKown (1977) Appendix A parameterization, matching the schema runner bit-for-bit. Connor-Stevens (1971) remains the experimental A-current lineage.",
